#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:1 25b6e9a65b1c4fb49685f1624fd5a7dc
msgid "数据流详解"
msgstr "Data flow in detail"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:3 2653a730174346678c5e662a53e048bd
msgid ""
"从命令行参数到模型输出的端到端数据流：CLI 解析 → 数据加载 → 训练循环 → 评估 → 输出。本文基于 UniKT "
"源码，所有代码引用可追溯到具体文件和行号。"
msgstr ""
"The end-to-end data flow from CLI arguments to model output: CLI parsing → data "
"loading → training loop → evaluation → output. This document is based on the UniKT "
"source; every code reference is traceable to a specific file and line number."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:5 b95a552dddc3438f809d6577da48510a
msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:23 dca4d348f36e49a09ae94f240c32610a
msgid "CLI 入口层"
msgstr "CLI entry layer"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:25 9732eae283ca4cb38532c49325e3f4a2
msgid ""
"训练入口通常为项目根目录的 ``train.py``（或 ``optuna_search.py`` "
"用于超参数搜索，``case_analysis.py`` 用于案例分析）。以标准训练为例，用户执行："
msgstr ""
"The training entry point is usually ``train.py`` in the project root (or "
"``optuna_search.py`` for hyperparameter search, ``case_analysis.py`` for case "
"analysis). For a standard training run, the user executes:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:31 a4687c148acb454180f0be7cebb35fee
msgid "参数解析流程"
msgstr "Argument parsing flow"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:33 da05b619ca034696a3a39007aac06d9d
msgid "命令行参数由两层构成：**通用参数组**（无条件加载）和**模型专属参数组**（按 ``-m`` 指定的模型动态注入）。"
msgstr ""
"CLI arguments consist of two layers: **general parameter groups** (loaded "
"unconditionally) and a **model-specific parameter group** (dynamically injected based "
"on the model specified by ``-m``)."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:52 eb80979caba147c9b8a95099fba38e07
msgid "通用参数组定义在 ``utils/config/param_config.py``："
msgstr "The general parameter groups are defined in ``utils/config/param_config.py``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:54 af0a6d832f674124b83e4f5c0285ec2f
msgid ""
"**DataParams**（）：``--dataset``、``--fold``、``--kfold``、``--max_seq_len``、``--data_base_path``"
" 等"
msgstr ""
"**DataParams** (): ``--dataset``, ``--fold``, ``--kfold``, ``--max_seq_len``, "
"``--data_base_path``, etc."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:55 1d3521a79c004e02abe4328523b63100
msgid ""
"**GeneralParams**（）：``--device``、``--seed``、``--log_dir``、``--no_swanlab``、``--deterministic``"
" 等"
msgstr ""
"**GeneralParams** (): ``--device``, ``--seed``, ``--log_dir``, ``--no_swanlab``, "
"``--deterministic``, etc."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:56 c2e034f3d2044d6199da7f897ed13e89
msgid "**EarlyStoppingParams**（）：``--es_monitor``、``--es_mode``、``--es_patience``、``--es_min_delta``"
msgstr ""
"**EarlyStoppingParams** (): ``--es_monitor``, ``--es_mode``, ``--es_patience``, "
"``--es_min_delta``"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:57 070af536a3164f109d82f300090086db
msgid ""
"**CompileParams**（）：``--compile``、``--compile_mode``、``--compile_backend``"
" 等"
msgstr ""
"**CompileParams** (): ``--compile``, ``--compile_mode``, ``--compile_backend``, etc."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:58 6f3a521b12eb440eb41fe68626b5124d
msgid "**SamplingParams**（）：``--sample_size``、``--sample_strategy`` 等"
msgstr "**SamplingParams** (): ``--sample_size``, ``--sample_strategy``, etc."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:60 c4f7a25cc7334672870fceb9543f105f
msgid ""
"每个参数组都是 ``BaseParamConfig`` 的子类，通过 ``define_params`` "
"方法定义参数规范（类型、默认值、帮助文本），由 ``add_args(parser)`` 类方法注入到 "
"``argparse.ArgumentParser``。``bool`` 类型自动映射为 ``store_true`` 或 "
"``store_false`` action（``param_config.py`` ）。"
msgstr ""
"Each parameter group is a subclass of ``BaseParamConfig`` that defines the parameter "
"spec (type, default, help text) via the ``define_params`` method, and is injected "
"into ``argparse.ArgumentParser`` by the ``add_args(parser)`` classmethod. ``bool`` "
"types are automatically mapped to the ``store_true`` or ``store_false`` action "
"(``param_config.py``)."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:62 07d3abcde2b14150a957ea7080c1c69f
msgid "模型专属参数以 GIKT 为例，在 ``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py`` 中："
msgstr ""
"Taking GIKT as an example, the model-specific parameters live in "
"``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:99 514d0cd0d8b54377ba64be4cdaae1200
msgid ""
"``train.py`` 先加载通用参数组，再根据 ``-m`` 指定的模型名从已注册参数中获取对应参数类并调用 "
"``add_args(parser)``，实现**通用参数 + 模型参数**的分层解析。"
msgstr ""
"``train.py`` first loads the general parameter groups, then looks up the registered "
"parameter class for the model specified by ``-m`` and calls ``add_args(parser)``, "
"achieving the layered parsing of **general parameters + model parameters**."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:101 6849f5341678407ea6af0f19f4d23408
msgid "数据加载层"
msgstr "Data loading layer"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:103 3763678791ac485996b97fb9feb58a0a
msgid "数据流进入模型训练器之前需要经过两步数据准备：**原始数据加载与清洗**（DataSource）和**模型级数据切分与构造**（ModelData）。"
msgstr ""
"Before the data flow reaches the model trainer, it goes through two preparation "
"steps: **raw data loading and cleaning** (DataSource) and **model-level data splitting "
"and construction** (ModelData)."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:105 a9147572f02c4cefb10340927bd05f5b
msgid "第一步：DataSource 管线"
msgstr "Step 1: DataSource pipeline"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:107 e75ebd911bab4602a403854402bf1e24
msgid ""
"数据源系统由 ``utils/data_process/`` 包实现，管线在 ``DataSource`` "
"基类（``data_source.py`` ）中定义："
msgstr ""
"The data-source system is implemented by the ``utils/data_process/`` package; the "
"pipeline is defined in the ``DataSource`` base class (``data_source.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:113 56c64b4c69f2410589960ff8e2dde5ea
msgid "每个步骤的作用："
msgstr "The role of each step:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:115 9c53a64a53ee45a2ad624d34ebe1c665
msgid "``load_src_data``（）：从磁盘加载原始数据（CSV、Parquet 或自定义格式），**抽象方法，每个数据集自行实现**"
msgstr ""
"``load_src_data`` (): loads raw data from disk (CSV, Parquet, or a custom format); "
"**abstract method, implemented per dataset**"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:116 ae428f910c36416a9ab6d78183bbeac9
msgid "``clean_raw_data``（）：去除无效记录、统一列名、处理缺失值"
msgstr "``clean_raw_data`` (): removes invalid records, unifies column names, handles missing values"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:117 d6fbfb58296d4e64906129796605b99d
msgid "``transform_data``（）：转换为标准格式，产出 5 类数据："
msgstr "``transform_data`` (): converts to the standard format and produces 5 kinds of data:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:118 9a981580bbdd42c197fd992afc7f04d8
msgid "``sequence_data``：用户交互序列（user / question / label / timestamp）"
msgstr "``sequence_data``: user interaction sequences (user / question / label / timestamp)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:119 d0cf34c536db4cb79f37def144ddf13a
msgid "``split_question_sequence``：按知识点切分后的问题级序列"
msgstr "``split_question_sequence``: question-level sequences split by knowledge concept"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:120 bf04d711f47c4f4dac730007342e048d
msgid "``split_skill_sequence``：按知识点切分后的技能级序列"
msgstr "``split_skill_sequence``: skill-level sequences split by knowledge concept"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:121 05761e1bd327495785632b31a9c1bfa9
msgid "``windowlate_data``：滑动窗口评估数据"
msgstr "``windowlate_data``: sliding-window evaluation data"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:122 67d40279ef3948e3bd28d9362f06ff9d
msgid "``relation_data/*``：关系表家族（``question_skill``、``question_assignment``、``question_template``）"
msgstr ""
"``relation_data/*``: the relation-table family (``question_skill``, "
"``question_assignment``, ``question_template``)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:123 fdf7fc063c194a918fbfef99dbe13e6b
msgid "``save_data``（）：保存为 Parquet 并执行数据一致性校验（MD5 哈希、question_id 交叉校验、列检查）"
msgstr ""
"``save_data`` (): saves to Parquet and runs data consistency checks (MD5 hash, "
"question_id cross-check, column checks)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:125 877cc30a7f8c43a0b2d52f2d05164297
msgid ""
"**注意：** UniKT 全链路使用 **Polars** DataFrame 和 Parquet 格式，不使用 pandas。与 pandas"
" 最大的差异是 Polars 没有行索引，所有数据操作通过列名和表达式完成。"
msgstr ""
"**Note:** UniKT uses **Polars** DataFrames and the Parquet format end to end, not "
"pandas. The biggest difference from pandas is that Polars has no row index; all data "
"operations are done via column names and expressions."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:127 a98686a92c164b4184cf4e5567da35b1
msgid ""
"数据集通过 ``@register_data_source`` 装饰器注册到 ``DATA_SOURCES`` 全局表。导入 "
"``utils.data_process`` 时触发 AST 静态发现（``__init__.py`` ），扫描 "
"``data_process/`` 下所有 ``.py`` 的 ``@register_data_source(\"数据集名\")`` "
"装饰器，建立懒索引。"
msgstr ""
"Datasets are registered into the ``DATA_SOURCES`` global registry via the "
"``@register_data_source`` decorator. Importing ``utils.data_process`` triggers AST "
"static discovery (``__init__.py``), which scans all ``.py`` files under "
"``data_process/`` for ``@register_data_source(\"dataset_name\")`` decorators and "
"builds a lazy index."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:129 22020ae050ad4c77aa75cf7bd6c2e9c9
msgid "使用时通过工厂函数获取："
msgstr "At use time, get an instance via a factory function:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:137 ea698a87f0f843fbaa0e91aa8e940b80
msgid "``get_data_source``（``__init__.py`` ）内部查找已注册的数据源并实例化。"
msgstr "``get_data_source`` (``__init__.py``) looks up the registered data source and instantiates it."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:139 f1fea99ec62948de87c0cfa989c200b8
msgid ""
"当前支持 11 "
"个数据集：``algebra2005``、``algebra2006``、``assistments09/12/15/17``、``bridge2006``、``ednet_kt1``、``junyi2015``、``nips2020_t34``、``slepemapy``。"
msgstr ""
"Currently 11 datasets are supported: ``algebra2005``, ``algebra2006``, "
"``assistments09/12/15/17``, ``bridge2006``, ``ednet_kt1``, ``junyi2015``, "
"``nips2020_t34``, ``slepemapy``."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:141 06bbfde858fa412b84c88579255482a9
msgid "第二步：ModelData 准备"
msgstr "Step 2: ModelData preparation"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:143 0702704b78494150b04edbb8f8c4d793
msgid ""
"DataSource 产出的是原始交互序列，ModelData 负责将其转换为模型可消费的训练/验证/测试张量。基类 "
"``BaseModelData``（``utils/model_data/base_model_data.py`` ）提供以下通用能力："
msgstr ""
"DataSource produces raw interaction sequences; ModelData converts them into "
"train/val/test tensors that the model can consume. The base class ``BaseModelData`` "
"(``utils/model_data/base_model_data.py``) provides the following general capabilities:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:145 2bd4539b53854f7da88bc4811bbdcd8b
msgid "``prepare_data(args)``：**抽象方法**，每个模型子类实现，是数据准备的入口"
msgstr ""
"``prepare_data(args)``: **abstract method**, implemented by each model subclass; the "
"entry point of data preparation"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:146 5c5e81ec9fda46ccb57c1a81977cc1c1
msgid ""
"``split_kfold_data(*arrays, fold_idx)``（）：基于用户级别的 K-fold 划分，同一个用户的所有交互不会跨"
" fold"
msgstr ""
"``split_kfold_data(*arrays, fold_idx)`` (): user-level K-fold split; all interactions "
"of a single user never cross folds"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:147 9760e7671de041a9806ec9b0ea191dc7
msgid "``split_data(*arrays, val_ratio, test_ratio)``（）：随机划分（非 K-fold 模式）"
msgstr "``split_data(*arrays, val_ratio, test_ratio)`` (): random split (non-K-fold mode)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:148 5e1eb7512747463b9fff6dc1fc5d6e90
msgid "``calculate_question_difficulty(exclude_fold)``（）：使用正确率 × 置信度 + 回归均值计算题目难度"
msgstr ""
"``calculate_question_difficulty(exclude_fold)`` (): computes question difficulty using "
"accuracy × confidence + regression mean"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:149 d583ba50148d4d7faae2ccfa57d83365
msgid "``build_relationship_matrix(edge_type)``（）：构建二值或计数关系矩阵（用于图模型）"
msgstr ""
"``build_relationship_matrix(edge_type)`` (): builds a binary or count relation matrix "
"(for graph models)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:150 77d3e74deb99491b92bb108163519fd6
msgid "``disk_cache``（）：基于 pickle 的磁盘缓存装饰器，通过 ``--cache`` 启用"
msgstr ""
"``disk_cache`` (): a pickle-based disk cache decorator, enabled via ``--cache``"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:152 4290869fb6224cae939cc33289829d09
msgid "UniKT 提供两个平行的 ModelData 分支，服务不同粒度的模型："
msgstr "UniKT provides two parallel ModelData branches serving models of different granularities:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:154 4411ba678a5349519416ecc8412e1324
msgid "**SkillModelData — KC 级模型**（``utils/model_data/skill_model_data.py`` L1）"
msgstr "**SkillModelData — KC-level models** (``utils/model_data/skill_model_data.py`` L1)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:156 3f12aa1b3d3a425ab382d49ab423ffff
msgid ""
"面向需要技能（Knowledge Component）序列的模型（如 DKT、GIKT）。``build_sequence_data``（）从 "
"``data_src.get_split_skill_sequence_data`` 构建技能序列，产出 5 个等长数组（shape 均为 "
"``[num_users, max_seq_len]``）："
msgstr ""
"For models that need a skill (Knowledge Component) sequence (e.g. DKT, GIKT). "
"``build_sequence_data`` () builds the skill sequence from "
"``data_src.get_split_skill_sequence_data`` and produces 5 equal-length arrays (each "
"with shape ``[num_users, max_seq_len]``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:158 eca2f4267d4647a7be680137e5155c57
msgid "``user_sequence``：技能（KC）ID 序列"
msgstr "``user_sequence``: skill (KC) ID sequence"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:159 f6ef7770ebc14aedb219b45bb8b2f039
msgid "``user_response``：作答正误（0/1）"
msgstr "``user_response``: response correctness (0/1)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:160 eaa4ca235079424390f8b0a068a97b22
msgid "``user_mask``：有效位置掩码（padding 位置为 0）"
msgstr "``user_mask``: valid-position mask (0 at padding positions)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:161 d70e973b47b34ce4b076112c8fba1bcd
msgid "``user_id_sequence``：用户 ID 序列"
msgstr "``user_id_sequence``: user ID sequence"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:162 eda45baf36664199ab9b86383b125522
msgid "``user_question``：题目 ID 序列"
msgstr "``user_question``: question ID sequence"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:183 66eedcb7eb0f4cdeac35f75130b3a3af
msgid ""
"**QuestionModelData — Question "
"级模型**（``utils/model_data/question_model_data.py`` L1）"
msgstr ""
"**QuestionModelData — Question-level models** "
"(``utils/model_data/question_model_data.py`` L1)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:185 9645dfab7bd74ca6a18a43690f75394d
msgid ""
"面向需要题目级交互图和异构图数据的模型（如 HDHKT、GIKT 图分支）。``load_sequence_data``（）从 "
"``data_src.get_split_question_sequence_data`` 构建题目序列，产出 4 个数组。额外提供图构建能力："
msgstr ""
"For models that need question-level interaction graphs and heterogeneous graph data "
"(e.g. HDHKT, the GIKT graph branch). ``load_sequence_data`` () builds the question "
"sequence from ``data_src.get_split_question_sequence_data`` and produces 4 arrays. It "
"additionally provides graph-construction capabilities:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:187 6ea67cd5159e4901bdcd328b92bcf0cf
msgid ""
"``build_hetero_graph(edge_types, edge_attrs, directed, "
"node_features)``（）：构建 PyTorch Geometric ``HeteroData``"
msgstr ""
"``build_hetero_graph(edge_types, edge_attrs, directed, "
"node_features)`` (): builds a PyTorch Geometric ``HeteroData``"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:188 6d8c32bc71184744af1d4998ff76265e
msgid "``build_hyper_graph(edge_type, vertex_type)``（）：构建 DHG ``Hypergraph``"
msgstr "``build_hyper_graph(edge_type, vertex_type)`` (): builds a DHG ``Hypergraph``"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:190 1872b0f794bb425e8d4c94fe7ee6b1d5
msgid "**K-fold 划分机制**（``base_model_data.py`` ）："
msgstr "**K-fold splitting mechanism** (``base_model_data.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:201 74b2f7e5dcc9494c9e2ca42de5f1425f
msgid "划分是 **用户级别** 的——同一用户的所有交互序列完整落入一个 fold，避免数据泄露。这个设计保证验证集和测试集中的用户是训练阶段从未见过的。"
msgstr ""
"The split is **user-level** — all interaction sequences of the same user fall entirely "
"into one fold, preventing data leakage. This design guarantees that users in the "
"validation and test sets were never seen during training."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:203 a712afa8c76c4158b55e45562d2ed883
msgid "训练循环层"
msgstr "Training loop layer"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:205 b65355837e314e588e26d344dc044c92
msgid "训练器构建：链式 Builder 模式"
msgstr "Trainer construction: chained Builder pattern"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:207 9369980fd0b24a2cb97678e4374d5b96
msgid ""
"每个模型训练器（例如 ``GIKTTrainer`` 在 ``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py`` ）在 "
"``__init__`` 中通过链式调用构建训练环境："
msgstr ""
"Each model trainer (e.g. ``GIKTTrainer`` in ``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py``) builds the "
"training environment via chained calls inside ``__init__``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:237 291cd77fa70442518e01757b21da0a8f
msgid ""
"``build`` 方法（``base_trainer.py`` ）负责验证 4 个配置块必须全部设置、创建 "
"DataLoader、初始化回调链、设置随机种子、创建指标累积器。之后调用 ``run`` 启动训练。"
msgstr ""
"The ``build`` method (``base_trainer.py``) verifies that all 4 config blocks are set, "
"creates the DataLoader, initializes the callback chain, sets the random seed, and "
"creates the metric accumulator. It then calls ``run`` to start training."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:239 63e151e5e3a44628a8ede8aa669a1a04
msgid "训练循环核心"
msgstr "Training loop core"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:241 0504472d6cd54fbf937229fec110d8fc
msgid "训练循环在 ``_run_training_loop``（``base_trainer.py`` ）中实现："
msgstr "The training loop is implemented in ``_run_training_loop`` (``base_trainer.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:269 faba9f6aef7c4753b94ea76c559d2ca8
msgid ""
"训练批次（``_run_train_batch``，）和验证批次（``_run_eval_batch``，）的核心区别：训练批次执行 "
"``opt.zero_grad → backward → clip_grad → opt.step`` 完整的梯度更新；验证批次用 "
"``@torch.inference_mode`` 禁用梯度计算，只做前向传播和损失计算。"
msgstr ""
"The key difference between a training batch (``_run_train_batch``,) and a validation "
"batch (``_run_eval_batch``,): the training batch runs the full gradient update "
"``opt.zero_grad → backward → clip_grad → opt.step``; the validation batch uses "
"``@torch.inference_mode`` to disable gradient computation and only does the forward "
"pass and loss computation."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:271 3d79db0a78a144638ece69ffde4aedcb
msgid "forward_pass 约定"
msgstr "forward_pass contract"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:273 3819d3b696904a2f86d3b88ceb445d19
msgid ""
"每个训练器子类必须实现 ``forward_pass(batch_data) → dict``（``base_trainer.py`` "
"，抽象方法）。返回值字典必须包含三个键："
msgstr ""
"Each trainer subclass must implement ``forward_pass(batch_data) → dict`` "
"(``base_trainer.py``, abstract method). The returned dict must contain three keys:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:283 f19b2b30ac034ca1ad072f914fa2f00f
msgid "可选扩展键：``\"y_score\"``（原始得分）、``\"y_prob\"``（sigmoid 概率）。"
msgstr "Optional extension keys: ``\"y_score\"`` (raw score), ``\"y_prob\"`` (sigmoid probability)."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:285 ffe89e2b9faf44f8ad015d3b2d1bd0f2
msgid ""
"**Next-item 对齐约定**（``base_trainer.py`` ）：``y_hat_full[t]`` 预测 "
"``response[t+1]``。``_extract_valid_predictions`` 提取 ``y_hat_full[:,:-1]``"
" 与 ``response[:,1:]`` 的对齐，掩码同样取相邻位置的交集 ``mask[:,:-1] & "
"mask[:,1:]``。部分模型输出 ``[B, S-1]``（比输入少一位），通过 "
"``_pad_to_full_sequence``（）在前端补零对齐。"
msgstr ""
"**Next-item alignment convention** (``base_trainer.py``): ``y_hat_full[t]`` predicts "
"``response[t+1]``. ``_extract_valid_predictions`` extracts the alignment of "
"``y_hat_full[:,:-1]`` with ``response[:,1:]``; the mask likewise takes the "
"intersection of adjacent positions ``mask[:,:-1] & mask[:,1:]``. Some models output "
"``[B, S-1]`` (one element shorter than the input); ``_pad_to_full_sequence`` () "
"zero-pads the front to align."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:287 600b12aa0696413688d7eca90b48e062
msgid "以 GIKT 的 ``forward_pass`` 为例（``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py`` ）："
msgstr "Using GIKT's ``forward_pass`` as an example (``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:317 77dc4dc1d0184cea8a3fe3e1d9b0543a
msgid "评估层"
msgstr "Evaluation layer"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:319 3cd04a1390f84a0a9d82301a494158e3
msgid ""
"每个 epoch "
"结束后，训练循环自动在验证集上评估指标。``MetricsAccumulator``（``utils/training/metrics.py``）在验证阶段收集所有"
" batch 的 ``y_hat`` 和 ``y_label``，在 phase 结束时聚合并计算："
msgstr ""
"After each epoch ends, the training loop automatically evaluates metrics on the "
"validation set. ``MetricsAccumulator`` (``utils/training/metrics.py``) collects the "
"``y_hat`` and ``y_label`` of every batch during the validation phase and aggregates "
"them at the end of the phase to compute:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:321 f35395efb2b4425b85c2cc57a00120e1
msgid "**AUC**（ROC 曲线下面积）"
msgstr "**AUC** (area under the ROC curve)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:322 2e1ab8b1c91e4f409cc5f524264f9595
msgid "**ACC**（准确率）"
msgstr "**ACC** (accuracy)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:323 5221f434815440168008a6bcc1c5738d
msgid "**RMSE**（均方根误差）"
msgstr "**RMSE** (root mean squared error)"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:325 36d0085229c74f2c9252570cfde7cfda
msgid ""
"训练完全结束后，``_evaluate_on_test_set``（``base_trainer.py`` "
"）在测试集上执行相同流程。如果启用了早停且 ``--es_restore_best``，评估使用验证集上最佳模型的权重。"
msgstr ""
"After training fully completes, ``_evaluate_on_test_set`` (``base_trainer.py``) runs "
"the same flow on the test set. If early stopping is enabled and ``--es_restore_best`` "
"is set, evaluation uses the weights of the best model on the validation set."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:327 9d6500207bc644a3925f0a3ad8122373
msgid "输出层"
msgstr "Output layer"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:329 aceafdad7f53456b8810750734ce4872
msgid "目录结构"
msgstr "Directory structure"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:331 577e37a7566b4c74a72e1011f8593e68
msgid ""
"训练结果保存在 ``runs/<type>/<run_id>/``，由 "
"``ExperimentManager``（``utils/experiment_manager.py``）创建。以正常训练为例："
msgstr ""
"Training results are saved under ``runs/<type>/<run_id>/``, created by "
"``ExperimentManager`` (``utils/experiment_manager.py``). Taking normal training as an "
"example:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:343 80c4302a61fc459db2a1ba3fc86d2691
msgid "指标记录"
msgstr "Metric logging"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:345 7fed5263326d4358a8b27b3775185703
msgid ""
"UniKT 采用**双轨记录**：本地 CSV 始终记录（通过 "
"``LocalMetricLogger``，``utils/training/metric_logger.py``），SwanLab "
"云端记录可选（通过 ``SwanLabMetricLogger``），通过 ``--no_swanlab`` 关闭。训练期间每 epoch "
"记录一次聚合指标，若启用 ``--log_batch_metrics`` 则额外记录每个 batch 的损失。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT uses **dual-track logging**: local CSV is always recorded (via "
"``LocalMetricLogger``, ``utils/training/metric_logger.py``); SwanLab cloud logging is "
"optional (via ``SwanLabMetricLogger``) and can be turned off with ``--no_swanlab``. "
"During training, aggregate metrics are logged once per epoch; if "
"``--log_batch_metrics`` is enabled, the per-batch loss is also logged."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:347 9fc22a39cf2d44b781cf163577c1f6ab
msgid "回调系统输出"
msgstr "Callback system output"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:349 1f779378ed6c4272965b385b2b3f471c
msgid "``CallbackManager``（``utils/training/callbacks.py``）编排以下回调的输出："
msgstr "``CallbackManager`` (``utils/training/callbacks.py``) orchestrates the output of the following callbacks:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:351 f456a5729a6f470ca18fac105cba6d9a
msgid "**CheckpointCallback**：按监控指标保存最佳模型权重和每个 epoch 的检查点"
msgstr ""
"**CheckpointCallback**: saves the best model weights by the monitored metric and a "
"checkpoint for each epoch"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:352 6b187054eb8b43e98b2b4ab32466b6ba
msgid "**EarlyStoppingCallback**：当验证指标连续 ``patience`` 轮无改进时触发停止"
msgstr ""
"**EarlyStoppingCallback**: triggers a stop when the validation metric has not improved "
"for ``patience`` consecutive epochs"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:353 07d60fb7d37b4da288407f7daec82408
msgid "**MemoryCleanupCallback**：每个 epoch 结束后清理 GPU 缓存"
msgstr "**MemoryCleanupCallback**: clears the GPU cache after each epoch"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:354 477a1ace90794f24a55a8642f1f8a1fc
msgid "**TestEvaluationCallback**：训练完成后自动在测试集上评估"
msgstr "**TestEvaluationCallback**: automatically evaluates on the test set after training completes"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:356 4cf590044a5c4f5cb3025c40a48578fb
msgid "端到端数据流总览"
msgstr "End-to-end data flow overview"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:358 59e799f3c3a74677b4b6498e77728d53
msgid "将以上各层串联，一条 ``python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --fold 0`` 命令的完整数据流："
msgstr ""
"Chaining the above layers together, the complete data flow of a "
"``python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --fold 0`` command:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:408 2c420a96401842af93fcbbdc9cfdd29a
msgid "多阶段训练的数据流"
msgstr "Data flow of multi-stage training"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:410 f191744b5ec84d30a32c250cbfc2da88
msgid ""
"``MultiTrainer``（``utils/training/multi_trainer.py`` "
"）在单阶段训练之上叠加了**阶段切换**机制。每个阶段拥有独立的模型、优化器、损失函数、数据和早停配置，通过 "
"``StageComponents`` dataclass 封装。"
msgstr ""
"``MultiTrainer`` (``utils/training/multi_trainer.py``) layers a **stage-switching** "
"mechanism on top of single-stage training. Each stage has its own model, optimizer, "
"loss function, data, and early-stopping config, encapsulated by the "
"``StageComponents`` dataclass."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:424 421f0148ac0841e388df2395c4a6f3c6
msgid ""
"每个阶段调用 ``_run_training_loop`` 复用了 ``BaseTrainer`` 的核心训练逻辑，阶段之间的数据传递通过 "
"``on_stage_begin`` / ``on_stage_complete`` 钩子实现。例如 ABKT 模型在两个阶段（Knowledge"
" Mastery → Ability Modeling）之间传递知识状态矩阵。"
msgstr ""
"Each stage calls ``_run_training_loop``, reusing the core training logic of "
"``BaseTrainer``; data passing between stages is done via the ``on_stage_begin`` / "
"``on_stage_complete`` hooks. For example, the ABKT model passes the knowledge-state "
"matrix between its two stages (Knowledge Mastery → Ability Modeling)."

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:426 3f2ca858eb0a4c0f8843f3cb410d22a3
msgid "多阶段训练器在构造时接收 ``model=None``（``multi_trainer.py`` ），因为模型在各阶段内部动态构建："
msgstr ""
"The multi-stage trainer receives ``model=None`` at construction time "
"(``multi_trainer.py``), because the model is built dynamically inside each stage:"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:428 a5fad734079c4dc1920f7321f9b8b9f7
msgid ""
"``build_stages`` 返回 ``list[StageConfig]``，每个 ``StageConfig`` 通过 ``build``"
" 回调产出该阶段的 ``StageComponents``"
msgstr ""
"``build_stages`` returns ``list[StageConfig]``; each ``StageConfig`` produces the "
"``StageComponents`` for that stage via a ``build`` callback"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:429 03cb63336d134e2b942ce59756b76ca7
msgid ""
"运行时通过 ``_apply_stage`` 切换 "
"``self.model``、``self.opt``、``self.loss``、``self.train_data``、``self.epochs``、``self.early_stopping``"
" 等属性"
msgstr ""
"At runtime, ``_apply_stage`` swaps attributes such as ``self.model``, ``self.opt``, "
"``self.loss``, ``self.train_data``, ``self.epochs``, ``self.early_stopping``"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:430 f9692c81ac354b88bfd1d7043cf092a9
msgid "``forward_pass`` 通过 ``self._current_stage`` 区分阶段，路由到不同的前向逻辑"
msgstr ""
"``forward_pass`` distinguishes stages via ``self._current_stage`` and routes to "
"different forward logic"

#: ../../source/advanced/data-flow.md:432 ac6051714091479ea3f09ad2203cc317
msgid ""
"**注意：** ``BaseTrainer.build`` 必须先调 ``with_training`` / ``with_data`` / "
"``with_optimization`` / ``with_experiment`` 四个方法，否则 ``build`` 会抛 "
"``ValueError``。四个配置块分别对应 "
"``TrainingConfig``、``DataConfig``、``OptimizationConfig``、``ExperimentConfig``"
" dataclass（``utils/config/training_config.py``）。"
msgstr ""
"**Note:** ``BaseTrainer.build`` must first call the four methods ``with_training`` / "
"``with_data`` / ``with_optimization`` / ``with_experiment``, otherwise ``build`` raises "
"a ``ValueError``. The four config blocks correspond respectively to the "
"``TrainingConfig``, ``DataConfig``, ``OptimizationConfig``, ``ExperimentConfig`` "
"dataclasses (``utils/config/training_config.py``)."
